abstract: >-
  Local-first Python reconstruction of a 1998 Pioneer 10/11 energetic-particle
  analysis and an AI-assisted calendar-aware robustness reassessment. The
  historical replication is separated explicitly from the later exploratory
  signal-analysis stages.
keywords:
  - Pioneer 10
  - Pioneer 11
  - energetic particles
  - reproducibility
  - irregular sampling
  - Lomb-Scargle
  - red noise
